    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The Chat Bot Alpha Interface plugin allows you to easily integrate the  web component directly into your WordPress site via a CDN, without manually embedding scripts.</p>\n<p>You can configure the following in WP Admin &gt; Settings &gt; Chat Bot Settings:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bot Name</li>\n<li>Agent UUID</li>\n<li>Chat ID</li>\n<li>Icon Size</li>\n<li>Chatbot Width</li>\n<li>Chatbot Height</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This chatbot supports voice, customization options, and backend integration via Alpha Interface.</p>\n<h3>Source Code</h3>\n<p>The uncompressed, human-readable source code for this plugin can be found at:<br />\nhttps://github.com/clockhash-projects/hash-bot-fe</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>alpha-interface-dynamic-bot.zip</code> file via Plugins &gt; Add New &gt; Upload Plugin.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>The chatbot widget will appear on every page of your website.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Logo renamed</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Embed a modern AI voice chatbot on your WordPress site using Alpha Interface’s  widget. Lightweight, fast, and customizable.",
    "description": "<p>The Chat Bot Alpha Interface plugin allows you to easily integrate the  web component directly into your WordPress site via a CDN, without manually embedding scripts.</p>\n<p>You can configure the following in WP Admin &gt; Settings &gt; Chat Bot Settings:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bot Name</li>\n<li>Agent UUID</li>\n<li>Chat ID</li>\n<li>Icon Size</li>\n<li>Chatbot Width</li>\n<li>Chatbot Height</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This chatbot supports voice, customization options, and backend integration via Alpha Interface.</p>\n<h3>Source Code</h3>\n<p>The uncompressed, human-readable source code for this plugin can be found at:<br />\nhttps://github.com/clockhash-projects/hash-bot-fe</p>\n",
